  "tha-ap548:6.3": "pavattesuṃ → pavantiṃsu (machasaṃ)",
  "tha-ap548:8.1": "pavedajātesu → saṃvegajātesu (sīmu)",
  "tha-ap548:11.4": "santhuto → yo tava sāsane (syā)",
  "tha-ap548:12.1": "vīra → tādisohaṃ mahāvīra (syā)",
  "tha-ap548:21.2": "so → nikkhamitvā agārato (machasaṃ)",
  "tha-ap548:22.4": "sadevake → buddho āsi sadevake (machasaṃ)",
  "tha-ap548:23.1": "gamitvāna → isivhayaṃ pattaṃ gantvā (syā)",
  "tha-ap548:24.3": "māgadhagiriṃ → magadhe giriṃ (machasaṃ); maṅgalāgiriṃ (PTS)",
